{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":4,"ref":"proverbs 30:4","book":"proverbs","lang":"de","chapter":30,"translation":"Wer stieg auf zum Himmel und stieg hinab? Wer sammelte den Wind in seine Hände? Wer band die Wasser in ein Gewand? Wer richtete auf alle Enden der Erde? Was ist sein Name, und was ist der Name seines Sohnes — ⟨sagst du es⟩, dass du weißt?","tokens":[{"surface":"מי","gloss":"Wer"},{"surface":"עלה","gloss":"stieg auf"},{"surface":"שמים","gloss":"zum Himmel"},{"surface":"וירד","gloss":"und stieg hinab"},{"surface":"מי","gloss":"Wer"},{"surface":"אסף","gloss":"sammelte"},{"surface":"רוח","gloss":"den Wind"},{"surface":"בחפניו","gloss":"in seine Hände"},{"surface":"מי","gloss":"Wer"},{"surface":"צרר","gloss":"band"},{"surface":"מים","gloss":"die Wasser"},{"surface":"בשמלה","gloss":"in ein Gewand"},{"surface":"מי","gloss":"Wer"},{"surface":"הקים","gloss":"richtete auf"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"alle"},{"surface":"אפסי","gloss":"Enden"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"der Erde"},{"surface":"מה","gloss":"Was"},{"surface":"שמו","gloss":"ist sein Name"},{"surface":"ומה","gloss":"und was"},{"surface":"שם","gloss":"ist der Name"},{"surface":"בנו","gloss":"seines Sohnes"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"—"},{"surface":"תדע","gloss":"dass du weißt"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T04:31:51.095456495Z","model":"glm-5.2"}